## 1. Definitions

- **"Software"** means the source code, documentation, model files, configuration files, assets, and other files in this repository, excluding anything listed above as a **Restricted Asset**, which has its own rules under Section 5.

- **"Licensor"** means DMJ Labs.

- **"You"** means anyone using, copying, modifying, or distributing the Software under this license.

- **"Contribution"** means any code, documentation, model-related material, or other material You submit back to this project (for example, through a pull request).

- **"Fork"** means a copy of the Software, modified or not, maintained separately from the original project.

- **"Restricted Asset"** means any file, dataset, model, checkpoint, asset, or other material specifically named as such in the manifest at the top of this license. This project currently has none.

- **"Exempt Output"** means any output produced by running, training, evaluating, or otherwise using the Software that is specifically named above as exempt from the share-alike and attribution requirements in Section 3. This project currently has none.

